{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>ותפל</b> – like שוא (vanity), and likewise היאכל תפל (Job 6:6), which has no taste in a straight way, and likewise לא נתן תפלה (Job 1:22)." "<b>משאות</b> – prophecies, and likewise משא דמשק (Isaiah 17:1)." "<b>ומדוחים</b> – that they led astray from the straight way."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:33.119383594Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}